note.summary:
Tiny example:
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-east-1"
}

Use secure credential sources (env vars, profiles, CI/CD secrets), not hardcoded secrets.

Example:
terraform {
  required_providers {
    aws = {
      source = "hashicorp/aws"
      version = "~> 5.0"
    }
  }
}

Goal: repeatability, not random plugin drift.
